# WOW owner release signer (trust root). Fail closed until bootstrapped.
#
# Exactly one line, added by the repository owner from their own computer:
#   wow-owner namespaces="wow-release" ssh-ed25519 AAAA... owner@device
# Generate once (keep the private key off every agent-reachable machine/folder):
#   ssh-keygen -t ed25519 -f ~/.ssh/wow_owner_release -C wow-owner-release
#   (or -t ed25519-sk for a hardware key; always set a passphrase)
# Changing this file is an owner-only trust-root change.
